      "question": "According to the Q3 2026 regional performance report, which region grew net sales fastest year over year, and what were its Q3 2026 net sales?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T05:33:47.909139Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T05:33:53.571270Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "According to the Q3 2026 regional performance report, the **Northeast** region grew net sales fastest year over year at **+14.4%**, reaching **$37,736** in Q3 2026 net sales [1]. The report's executive summary and net-sales-by-region table both identify Northeast as the growth leader, up from $32,988 in Q3 2025 [1].\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Unstructured Retrieval evidence — 2 documents — evidence `hermes-receipt:e0bdf3dcb632a300b6d73a6b21587b4edd640700d90ca3b04d52cd5495d724ed`",
