                "chunkId": "retail.reports:f-ec81cf489eedf143:0003",
                "title": "regional-performance-q3-2026.pdf",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Regional Performance Report, Q3 2026\n1. Executive summary\nLumen Retail Group’s loyalty members placed 1,079 orders in the third quarter of 2026, worth $207,067 in net sales, +1.2% against the third quarter of 2025. The average order value was $192.\n- • Growth. Northeast grew fastest, at +14.4% year over year, to $37,736. Southeast was the slowest region at -12.4%.\n- • Largest region. E-commerce had the highest net sales of any region at $57,370, which is 27.7% of the chain.\n- • Returns. Returned value was $20,010, a return rate of 9.7% of net sales. E-commerce had the highest regional return rate at 12.0%.\n- • Top physical store. San Francisco Union Square (S21) led all physical stores with $19,982 in net sales.\n- • Plan. 3 of 7 categories finished below their Q3 net sales plan; 4 finished above it.\nHow to read this report: figures come from Lumen’s loyalty-member order tables (stores, customers, orders, order_items, returns) as of September 30, 2026. Definitions are in section 7. Dollar amounts are US dollars.",
                "metadata": {
                  "parser": "nemotron-parse-2.0",
                  "file_id": "f-ec81cf489eedf143",
                  "file_name": "regional-performance-q3-2026.pdf",
